WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Rook points a practice sword at a chair.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The chair moved two inches during breakfast.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Rook orders a full defensive formation.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Vellum asks the chair for its terms.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The chair requests a quieter table.
